---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const title = "Her AI Studio, Inc. AI Policy";
const description =
    "Our AI policy outlines the responsible and ethical use of artificial intelligence at Her AI Studio, Inc.";
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
    <Nav currentPath="/ai-policy" />

    <main id="main-content">
        <section id="ai-policy" class="studio-room room-discover" aria-labelledby="policy-heading">
            <div class="room-inner">
                <p class="room-label" data-reveal>AI Policy</p>
                <div class="discover-copy policy-copy">
                    <h2 id="policy-heading" class="discover-h2" data-reveal data-delay="1">
                        Responsible and Ethical Use of AI
                    </h2>
                    <p class="discover-lead" data-reveal data-delay="2">
                        This policy establishes guidelines for the responsible and ethical use of
                        artificial intelligence at Her AI Studio, Inc. A clear AI policy ensures
                        that technology serves our mission while protecting the rights, privacy,
                        and dignity of the high school women we empower.
                    </p>

                    <div class="policy-grid" data-reveal data-delay="3">
                        <article class="policy-card">
                            <h3 class="policy-card__title">AI Use</h3>
                            <p class="policy-card__body">
                                AI tools will be deployed to improve internal operations, enhance
                                educational services for beneficiaries, and provide data-driven
                                insights into program effectiveness. Administrative tasks,
                                scheduling, and communications will be streamlined through AI
                                automation. Educational tools, personalized learning experiences,
                                and mentorship matching will be enhanced to better serve students.
                                Student progress tracking, program effectiveness analysis, and
                                engagement pattern monitoring will be conducted to continuously
                                improve our offerings.
                            </p>
                        </article>

                        <article class="policy-card">
                            <h3 class="policy-card__title">Interactions with Beneficiaries</h3>
                            <p class="policy-card__body">
                                AI tools will interact directly with high school women participants
                                through learning platforms and personalized recommendations, while
                                also supporting staff in program management and administrative
                                tasks. All AI systems that interface with students will be designed
                                with age-appropriate safeguards and clear communication about their
                                AI-driven nature. Human educators and mentors will maintain
                                meaningful involvement in all student interactions, ensuring that
                                technology enhances rather than replaces human connection and
                                guidance.
                            </p>
                        </article>

                        <article class="policy-card">
                            <h3 class="policy-card__title">Data Collection Practices</h3>
                            <p class="policy-card__body">
                                Personal data including names, contact information, and demographic
                                information will be collected and protected according to applicable
                                privacy regulations. Educational data such as learning progress,
                                skill assessments, and project work will be gathered to personalize
                                learning experiences and measure program impact. All data collection
                                will be transparent, with clear communication to students and their
                                guardians about what information is collected, how it is used, and
                                how long it is retained. Data minimization principles will be
                                followed, collecting only what is necessary to fulfill educational
                                and operational purposes.
                            </p>
                        </article>

                        <article class="policy-card">
                            <h3 class="policy-card__title">Ethical Risks and Concerns</h3>
                            <p class="policy-card__body">
                                Bias mitigation will be prioritized to ensure AI tools do not
                                disadvantage any groups of students based on race, socioeconomic
                                status, learning style, or other characteristics. Privacy and data
                                protection measures will safeguard student information through
                                encryption, secure storage, and strict access controls. Transparency
                                and accountability will be maintained by clearly communicating how
                                AI is used and ensuring responsible parties are identified for all
                                AI-driven processes. Equity and inclusion will be promoted by
                                ensuring all students have equal access to and benefit from AI
                                tools, with regular assessments to identify and address disparities.
                                Human oversight will be implemented for all AI-generated decisions
                                or recommendations that impact student learning, opportunities, or
                                program participation.
                            </p>
                        </article>

                        <article class="policy-card policy-card--wide">
                            <h3 class="policy-card__title">Accountability for AI Decisions</h3>
                            <p class="policy-card__body">
                                All staff members collectively share responsibility for ensuring AI
                                tools are used ethically and in alignment with Her AI Studio, Inc.'s
                                mission. Every team member who interacts with AI systems must
                                understand their role in maintaining fairness, transparency, and
                                student-centered practices. Regular team discussions and training
                                will reinforce shared accountability and create a culture of
                                responsible AI use.
                            </p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <Footer currentPath="/ai-policy" />
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .policy-copy {
        max-width: 100%;
    }

    .policy-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .policy-card {
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        padding: 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    }

    .policy-card--wide {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .policy-card__title {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--primary);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .policy-card__body {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .policy-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .policy-card--wide {
            grid-column: 1;
        }
    }
</style>
